        "faq1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I choose a perfume for different occasions?",
            "answer": "Match the scent's intensity to the occasion. Lighter fresh scents suit the office and daytime, while richer, longer-lasting fragrances suit evenings and events. Our lifestyle edits group them for you."
