        "faq2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What perfume should I wear to the office?",
            "answer": "For the office, choose a clean, moderate scent that is pleasant up close without filling the room. Fresh, light woody and subtle florals work well. See our Office Wear edit."
